----------------------------------------------------------------------------
Third-party code and dependencies
----------------------------------------------------------------------------

Peter Meerwald
  The legacy spread-spectrum DWT watermarking plugins (Dugad, Kim, Xie) are
  based on code from his thesis on wavelet-domain watermarking
  (University of Salzburg, 2001).

DDE Lab, Binghamton University (Jessica Fridrich et al.)
  The content-adaptive (HILL+STC) and SI-UNIWARD plugins, and the steganalysis
  benchmark harnesses, implement methods introduced in research published by
  the DDE Lab and collaborators. See the "Acknowledgement" section of README.md
  for full citations. The DDE Lab's own reference code is released by them for
  research and non-profit use and is not included in this repository.

